OksjPs3TbFvIh2pfBYHlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCZ7npHqCziBoJEx1fC1NNRfXUQvo8RYg-CzrbTnDezXw&oe=6A6B394D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Base.png", "id": "645995414509845", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_645995417843178_6506936718238058306_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bbnmd4FiVh4Q7kNvwFyU3zJ&_nc_oc=AdpDrScudTViq71xB8QZXuT-G68uTB-V6wHZ3pz5r2qgAIp6b4l4UDCxhJ9PDLlt9iw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBtSPbjPvrTBffR6jDkYaA7dSHYk_NV-sAbQkGVW1GdQw&oe=6A6B5108"}, "display_name": "Shadowline", "keywords": ["Shadow", "Line", "Shadowline", "Shooter", "Tactical"], "long_description": "Shadowline is a tactical shooter inspired by Wildlands and Gray Zone Warfare. As an Army Ranger, you are deployed into a hostile Vietnam warzone where a local military force has seized control. Your mission: gather critical intelligence, secure vital resources, and navigate the dangers of a volatile battlefield where every decision counts. Engage in strategic combat, adapt to evolving threats, and immerse yourself in a high-stakes operation where survival and success depend on your tactics.\n\nShadowline is developed by a solo developer and is being released initially in early access. Thank you for your support and hope you enjoy Shadowline! ", "short_description": "Shadowline is a tactical shooter inspired by Wildlands and Gray Zone Warfare. As an Army Ranger, you are deployed into a hostile Vietnam warzone where a local military force has seized control. Your mission: gather critical intelligence, secure vital resources, and navigate the dangers of a volatile battlefield where every decision counts. Engage in strategic combat, adapt to evolving threats, and immerse yourself in a high-stakes operation where survival and success depend on your tactics."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pri